{"3840970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Casey Noir and Carved Pumpkin's Latte", "steam_appid": 3840970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840970/extras/24cab83414bafc40d902111a3417111a.avif?t=1759331218\" width=1850 height=174 /></span>You've read the description. It's pretty self-explanatory. If you're in a mood for a short, about 2 hour long, visually-heavy mystery game that's just right for the autumn season, then why not give this a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840970/extras/fb6c1638dd8f4b79b1e48da651c2ab27.avif?t=1759331218\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if the free Halloween candy doesn't convince you, then read onwards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Casey Noir, an immortal, shadowy detective, who was invited to a Halloween party at a gothic hotel by a familiar face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the reunion is cut short when one of the guests is murdered, with the murderer being one of the guests still present.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the hotel and its surroundings, chat with suspects, collect evidence, and dig to the bottom of what's exactly going on this Halloween. The masks of the party-goers conceal, detract, and lie.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840970/extras/86058a821ee07ecd43d1f45aa67dee9b.avif?t=1759331218\" width=1850 height=174 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas